msgid "Lengthen the follow time, widen the stopped gap and lower the acceleration and lateral limits in bad weather. The weather is detected from the car's position; these offsets are what gets applied."
msgstr "恶劣天气下延长跟车时距、加大停车间距并降低加速度与横向加速度上限。天气根据车辆位置自动检测；此处设定的是实际叠加的补偿量。"

