msgstr "允许 Carrot 应用的转向指令充当转向灯。该功能会作用到车辆真实转向灯，因此默认关闭。"

#: selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/carrot_tuning_items.py
msgid "Let the FLM analyzer use the Steer Delay / Friction / Kp / Lat Accel / Ratio knobs instead of the values carParams already carries. Off keeps the analyzer reporting stock values, which is what the shipped tune compares against. Affects the analyzer only; nothing reaches the controller until runtime overrides are on and a profile is applied."
msgstr ""

#: selfdrive/ui/mici/layouts/settings/toggles.py
#: selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/mici/layouts/alpha_longitudinal.py
msgid ""
"Let the driving model control gas and brakes.\n"
"Includes stopping for red lights and stop signs.\n"
"Set speed is a maximum, not a target.\n"
"These are alpha features. Expect mistakes.\n"
"The path colors show acceleration and braking."
msgstr ""
"让驾驶模型控制油门和刹车。\n"
"包括红灯和停车标志前停车。\n"
"设定速度只是上限，不是目标。\n"
"这些是 alpha 功能，请预期会有失误。\n"
"路径颜色显示加速与刹车。"

#: selfdrive/ui/mici/layouts/settings/toggles.py
msgid "Let the driving model control the gas and brakes."
msgstr "让驾驶模型控制油门和刹车。"

#: selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/carrot_tuning_items.py
msgid "Let the lead vehicle's comfort-deceleration limit enter the MPC as a soft bound, which softens closing speed. Read once when plannerd starts - restart to apply."
msgstr ""

#: selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/carrot_tuning_items.py
msgid "Let the phone app drive the longitudinal plan: its target speed becomes a plan source, and its follow time, comfort braking and stop point reach the MPC. Off keeps stock sunnypilot behaviour. Needs a connected phone - without a fresh packet the source stays inactive."
msgstr "让手机 App 驱动纵向规划：其目标速度成为一个规划源，其跟车时距、舒适制动与停车点进入 MPC。关闭时保持 sunnypilot 原厂行为。需要手机保持连接——没有新鲜数据时该源自动失效。"

#: selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/carrot_tuning_items.py
msgid "Let the phone app guided-lane arrows block lane changes toward non-guided lanes. Only ever adds blocking."
msgstr "允许手机 App 的车道引导箭头封锁向非引导车道的变道，只会增加封锁。"

#: selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/carrot_tuning_items.py
msgid "Let the speed-limit resolver use the detected limit. It is folded into the map source, so a map limit stays authoritative and vision can only tighten it. Applies within about five seconds."
msgstr ""

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/toggles.py
msgid "Lets you choose how sunnypilot starts, catches up, and settles at the cruise speed. Emergency braking and stopping are unchanged."
msgstr "让您选择 sunnypilot 如何起步、追赶并稳定到巡航速度。紧急制动和停车不受影响。"

#: selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/mici/layouts/alpha_longitudinal.py
