#: selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/vehicle/brands/volkswagen.py
msgid "Macan Slope Comp Unlimited (sub-option): when Slope Compensation is ON, this removes the stock torque cap (option 2: min(max(stock_mom, 200))), giving small slopes room to act. When OFF, the stock cap applies (option 1: min(stock_mom))."
msgstr "Macan 坡度补偿放开限制（子选项）：当坡度补偿开启时，本选项移除原厂力矩上限（选项2：min(max(stock_mom,200))），给小坡度留出作用空间。关闭时应用原厂上限（选项1：min(stock_mom)）。"

#: selfdrive/ui/mici/layouts/settings/toggles.py
msgid "Macan Slope Compensation"
msgstr "Macan 坡度补偿"

#: selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/vehicle/brands/volkswagen.py
msgid "Macan Slope Compensation: when enabled, the IMU slope signal adds g*sin(slope) to the acceleration request - more torque uphill with a positive Verz request (declared acceleration, ~4.2*sin(slope)), a brief positive Verz ramp (+1.285 over 180ms) when overriding a deceleration with the gas pedal, and a brake tap downhill (prevents forward lurch). Default off = stock behavior. Onroad cycle restart is requested after toggling."
msgstr "Macan 坡度补偿：开启后 IMU 坡度信号向加速度请求加入 g*sin(坡度)——上坡增加力矩并发出正向 Verz 请求（加速声明，约 4.2×sin(坡度)）；减速中踩油门超驰时短暂发出正向 Verz 斜坡（+1.285/180ms，加速声明仪式）；下坡轻点刹车（防止前冲）。默认关闭=原厂行为。切换后需重启行程周期。"

msgid "Macan Slope Compensation: when enabled, the IMU slope signal adds g*sin(slope) to the acceleration request - more torque uphill with a positive Verz request (declared acceleration, ~4.2*sin(slope)), and a brake tap downhill (prevents forward lurch). Default off = stock behavior. Onroad cycle restart is requested after toggling."
msgstr "Macan 坡度补偿：开启后 IMU 坡度信号向加速度请求加入 g*sin(坡度)——上坡增加力矩并发出正向 Verz 请求（加速声明，约 4.2×sin(坡度)），下坡轻点刹车（防止前冲）。默认关闭=原厂行为。切换后需重启行程周期。"

msgid "Macan Slope Compensation: when enabled, the IMU slope signal adds g*sin(slope) to the acceleration request - more torque uphill, and a brake tap downhill (prevents forward lurch). Default off = stock behavior. Onroad cycle restart is requested after toggling."
msgstr "Macan 坡度补偿：启用后，IMU 坡度信号会将 g*sin(坡度) 叠加到加速度请求上——上坡增加力矩，下坡轻点刹车（防止惯性前冲）。默认关闭=原厂行为。切换后请求重新启动 onroad 周期。"

msgid "Macan Steering Params"
msgstr "Macan 转向系数"

msgid "Macan Steering Params (experimental): when enabled, uses calibrated steerRatio 18.0 / friction 0.52 instead of stock values. Calibration shows 22% cross-route spread and latAccelFactor data is insufficient, so this is EXPERIMENTAL - keep off until field data confirms."
msgstr "Macan 转向系数（实验性）：启用后使用标定值 steerRatio 18.0 / friction 0.52 替代原厂值。标定显示跨路线差异 22%，且 latAccelFactor 数据不足，因此这是实验功能——请保持关闭，直到路测数据确认。"

#: selfdrive/ui/mici/layouts/settings/toggles.py
msgid "Macan Stop and Go"
msgstr "Macan 起步跟停"

#: selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/vehicle/brands/volkswagen.py
msgid "Macan Stop and Go: when enabled, the vision model decides when to start, and openpilot sends the RESUME signal to release the stock parking hold (with a chime). When disabled, gently press the gas or SET/RESUME to resume (stock behavior)."
msgstr "Macan 起步跟停：启用后，由视觉模型决定何时起步，openpilot 发送 RESUME 信号解除原厂停车保持（伴随提示音）。禁用时，轻踩油门或按 SET/RESUME 起步（原厂行为）。"

#: selfdrive/ui/mici/layouts/settings/toggles.py
#: selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/vehicle/brands/volkswagen.py
msgid "Macan Verz Bridge"
msgstr "Macan 减速桥接"

#: selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/vehicle/brands/volkswagen.py
msgid "Macan Verz Bridge: when ON, the bridge applies a percentage-based ramp to smooth the requested deceleration (step = 1.25% x |verz|) - softens abrupt OP-initiated braking and kills the breath/pulse. When OFF, the verz request passes through un-smoothed (one-frame, no ramp). Deep braking (<= -1.5) and OEM brake requests still pass through either way for safety."
msgstr "Macan 减速桥接：启用时，桥对减速请求施加基于百分比的缓升（步长 = 1.25% × |verz|），柔化 openpilot 自发的骤刹并消除喘息感。关闭时减速请求不做平滑直接透传。深刹（≤ -1.5）与原厂刹车请求无论开关均直通以保证安全。"

#: selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/mici/layouts/steering.py
