msgid "zoompilot defaults to driving in chill mode. Experimental mode enables alpha-level features that aren't ready for chill mode. Experimental features are listed below:<br><h4>End-to-End Longitudinal Control</h4><br>Let the driving model control the gas and brakes. zoompilot will drive as it thinks a human would, including stopping for red lights and stop signs. Since the driving model decides the speed to drive, the set speed will only act as an upper bound. This is an alpha quality feature; mistakes should be expected.<br><h4>New Driving Visualization</h4><br>The driving visualization will transition to the road-facing wide-angle camera at low speeds to better show some turns. The Experimental mode logo will also be shown in the top right corner."
msgstr "zoompilot 默认以 chill 模式驾驶。实验模式会启用尚未达到 chill 模式要求、处于 alpha 阶段的特性。实验性功能如下：<br><h4>端到端纵向控制</h4><br>由驾驶模型控制油门和刹车。zoompilot 会像真人一样驾驶，包括红灯和停车标志前停车。由于车速由模型决定，设定速度仅作为上限。该功能为 alpha 质量，可能出现错误。<br><h4>全新驾驶可视化</h4><br>低速时驾驶可视化会切换到前视广角摄像头，以便更好地展示部分转弯。右上角还会显示实验模式标志。"

